  "description": "It Ain't Safe No More... is the sixth studio album by American rapper Busta Rhymes, released on November 26, 2002, by J Records and Busta Rhymes's Flipmode Records. It was his final album for J. The album was produced by Swizz Beatz, J Dilla, DJ Scratch, the Neptunes, and Rick Rock, among others. It features guest appearances by Mariah Carey, Sean Paul, Carl Thomas, and Spliff Star.",
